  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm welcome, featuring a unique composition notebook style design that adds character to any space. It is crafted for both comfort and durability, making it an ideal accent for classrooms and entryways. The doormat combines personalized charm with functional design, perfect for daily use.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher’s name for a special touch</li>\n<li>Soft and durable non-woven fabric top</li>\n<li>Non-slip neoprene rubber backing for stability</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Teacher, Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy, Neoprene Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft non-woven fabric top</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down, sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for use in classrooms, entryways, and RVs, creating a welcoming atmosphere for students and guests. Its durable construction makes it ideal for areas with frequent foot traffic.</p>",
